  "caption": "Taiwanese Hokkien 1980s heavy metal in the classic twin-guitar style. Two overdriven electric guitars playing galloping palm-muted riffs and harmonised lead lines in thirds; a pumping eighth-note bass guitar locked to the kick; big live drums with a double-kick run into each chorus; a shredding guitar solo with whammy dives in the bridge. Loud, roomy 1980s arena-metal production with gated reverb on the snare. A powerful high male tenor, clean and belting, holding a high note at the end of the last chorus, with a gang-shout backing on the hook. 168 BPM, E minor. Fearless, smoke-filled and laughing in the noise. No metalcore breakdowns, no growled vocals, no blast beats, no Chinese opera instruments, no pop chorus, no autotune.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n元宵暝 鹽水的廟口\n人擠甲 強欲袂喘氣\n我戴 全罩的安全帽\n三領牛仔褲 疊咧穿\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n面巾 縛佇頷頸\n炮城 一下點火\n\n[Chorus]\n蜂炮 衝過來\n千萬隻蜂 咧吼\n火 撞著 我的胸坎\n我毋走 我毋走\n\n[Verse]\n隔壁的阿伯 七十外\n伊每年 攏徛頭前排\n伊講 少年仔 跤徛予在\n炮若來 你就喝較大聲\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n第二座炮城 閣點火\n規條街 煙茫茫\n\n[Chorus]\n蜂炮 衝過來\n千萬隻蜂 咧吼\n火 撞著 我的安全帽\n阿伯 佮我 做伙喝\n\n[Bridge]\n天欲光 煙才散去\n牛仔褲 燒破三空\n阿伯 講 明年閣來\n\n[Chorus]\n蜂炮 衝過來\n明年 我徛頭前排\n火 撞著 我的胸坎\n我毋走 我喝較大聲\n\n[Outro]\n鹽水 明年見",
